{
  "_about": [
    "The hand-written half of the vocabulary. Every entity gets ONE tag. Precedence:",
    "pad layers (driveways.is_pad_layer) -> these rules on layer name / block name ->",
    "learned entries a person edited (layer_tags.learned.json) -> a name derived from",
    "the layer's words (layer_words.json: C-WATR-HYDR -> water_hydrant, family water)",
    "-> these rules on entity type -> the type itself -> 'other'.",
    "A rule: tag, on (layer | name | type), match (equals | endswith | startswith |",
    "contains | regex), needle, optional glyph (site-map character), family (the",
    "word a family query such as find_entities('water') groups it under) and",
    "priority (lower wins). Layer matching is case-insensitive; endswith/contains",
    "make an xref-prefixed layer such as 'x-plat (ph1a)|c-lots-line' resolve too.",
    "Utility layers (c-watr, c-sswr, c-strm ...) have no rules here on purpose: the",
    "word dictionary names them, with the part (main, hydrant, inlet) in the tag.",
    "glyph_priority / combos: which tag or family paints a site-map cell. merge: xref",
    "layer suffixes pulled into the index. conflicts: the gate's 'inside' tags and",
    "proximity clearance."
  ],
